\emph on
breakthrough
\emph default
 (ruptura) macroscópico:
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
t_{D,bt}\approx\frac{1}{13,7741}\approx0,0726\text{ PVI}
\]

\end_inset


\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\overline{S}_{w,bt}=S_{wi}+\frac{1}{m_{max}}=0,40+0,0726=0,4726
\]

\end_inset


